    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 52,
        "endOffset": 78,
        "text": "when you take into account",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "ADC80EED5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 198,
        "text": "It's hard enough to navigate just a single career transition, but you're far more prepared than you think to navigate your next job change and all the ones that come after. [The Way We Work] I’m Dr.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F4975956EA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 128,
        "text": "Michelle Weise, and I advise companies and educational institutions on how to prepare workers for successful and longer careers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8987BD445E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 32,
        "endOffset": 52,
        "text": "how you can navigate",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FB7837142F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 40,
        "text": "Number one, highlight your human skills.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FEE148DE52",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 113,
        "text": "When we talk about skills, we tend to focus on hard skills like coding, editing, data visualization or budgeting.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A42499334E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 50,
        "text": "But human skills need to share the spotlight, too.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "82DC92BDC3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "These are skills like adaptability, collaboration, exercising judgment or mediating tense situations.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5C692B8190",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 89,
        "text": "They may not always show up in obvious ways on your resume, but they have enormous value.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0834A6B9D5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "To surface your human skills, make a timeline of all of your experiences, both personal and professional.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A8A22B9C25",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 20,
        "text": "Do you see patterns?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "38167F52C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 36,
        "text": "Have certain skills grown over time?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "78BFFFC9A4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 70,
        "endOffset": 92,
        "text": "communicating in chaos",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C6ED53D595",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 6,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "your stint as a barista",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1F24BB2372",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 91,
        "endOffset": 125,
        "text": "strengths like patience or empathy",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "AE97513C47",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
